DEFECTS FOUND AND FIXED DURING THIS PHASE (both caught by new tests):
  1. Throwing inside a Prisma interactive transaction ROLLED BACK the
     expired-activation-token cleanup, leaving a dead token probeable.
     Fixed: the transaction returns an outcome; the failure is raised
     outside it so the cleanup commits. Caught by T-A-023.
  2. emailSchema validated BEFORE trimming, so a pasted address with
     surrounding whitespace was rejected as malformed.
     Fixed: normalise then validate via .pipe(). Caught by T-A-030.

